### Booking API Tests

### Create a booking (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token=<token_from_login>

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "amount": 99.99
}

###

### Get user bookings (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/user/1
Cookie: access_token=<token_from_login>
